1
00:00:19,227 --> 00:00:20,103
What?

2
00:00:27,360 --> 00:00:30,321
Jotaro Kujo…

3
00:00:30,989 --> 00:00:32,574
It's over.

4
00:00:32,657 --> 00:00:34,868
You have no allies left.

5
00:00:34,951 --> 00:00:37,454
You will be defeated before
the new moon arrives!

6
00:00:40,999 --> 00:00:43,501
You're mistaken, Emporio.

7
00:00:44,085 --> 00:00:45,754
As I thought, fate…

8
00:00:45,837 --> 00:00:50,884
gives me trials, yet sides with me.

9
00:00:52,927 --> 00:00:54,012
Ermes,

10
00:00:54,095 --> 00:00:56,264
pick up the gun and shoot him.

11
00:00:57,432 --> 00:00:59,768
See Moon!

12
00:00:59,851 --> 00:01:02,228
Star Platinum: The World!

13
00:01:10,904 --> 00:01:12,739
Once the time starts again,

14
00:01:12,822 --> 00:01:14,949
the harpoon will impale you.

15
00:01:24,459 --> 00:01:26,044
The harpoon missed.

16
00:01:26,544 --> 00:01:28,213
He dodged during my time stop.

17
00:01:28,713 --> 00:01:30,256
That priest…

18
00:01:30,340 --> 00:01:31,508
He's unharmed.

19
00:01:32,467 --> 00:01:35,345
The Space Shuttle is in the air!

20
00:01:35,887 --> 00:01:39,974
The priest is inside
the exhibition Shuttle!

21
00:01:40,058 --> 00:01:41,267
Damn…

22
00:01:41,351 --> 00:01:44,145
he's not only trying to get away.

23
00:01:44,813 --> 00:01:45,730
Don't tell me…

24
00:01:46,314 --> 00:01:49,192
he learned something
that he shouldn't have,

25
00:01:50,318 --> 00:01:53,279
a condition that will allow him
to complete his Stand!

26
00:01:55,949 --> 00:01:59,410
It is you who brought
this Pucchi to heaven.

27
00:02:00,120 --> 00:02:04,040
All this time, even in prison,
my allies were you.

28
00:02:04,833 --> 00:02:07,502
Father in Heaven,

29
00:02:07,585 --> 00:02:10,296
guide me!

30
00:02:10,380 --> 00:02:13,550
Watch over me,

31
00:02:13,633 --> 00:02:15,260
that I shall not stray from my path.

32
00:02:15,343 --> 00:02:19,722
I give myself to thee!

33
00:02:21,099 --> 00:02:22,433
Yes, I feel it!

34
00:02:28,773 --> 00:02:31,401
The position! It's here!

35
00:04:02,742 --> 00:04:04,911
EPISODE 36: MAIDEN HEAVEN (1)

36
00:04:04,994 --> 00:04:10,124
I felt the power surge at the position
where I dodged Jotaro's harpoon.

37
00:04:10,208 --> 00:04:14,963
You, the Joestar bloodline,
helped me reach heaven!

38
00:04:16,381 --> 00:04:17,215
Look!

39
00:04:17,799 --> 00:04:18,633
It's Anastasia!

40
00:04:18,716 --> 00:04:21,344
He's found his way
onto the Shuttle's outer shell!

41
00:04:21,427 --> 00:04:24,013
Eat this! Diver Drive!

42
00:04:34,232 --> 00:04:36,526
My ability is no longer See Moon.

43
00:04:37,026 --> 00:04:39,487
At last, the time for heaven has come.

44
00:04:41,948 --> 00:04:43,533
My ability is complete!

45
00:04:43,616 --> 00:04:45,326
The power of gravity

46
00:04:45,410 --> 00:04:48,621
radiates throughout my body!

47
00:04:53,376 --> 00:04:54,836
Rot in hell,

48
00:04:54,919 --> 00:04:57,588
you scumbag!

49
00:05:29,245 --> 00:05:30,371
It's news at noon.

50
00:05:31,372 --> 00:05:34,959
The incident on the State Road 405
at Cape Canaveral

51
00:05:35,043 --> 00:05:37,170
has accounted for 2,000 casualties.

52
00:05:37,253 --> 00:05:39,505
It was originally believed to be
caused by road cave-ins,

53
00:05:40,006 --> 00:05:43,426
however, there seems to be
other underlying causes.

54
00:05:43,509 --> 00:05:46,179
Helicopters have crashed,
and rescue missions have failed.

55
00:05:46,763 --> 00:05:49,307
We will continue to report
after the break.

56
00:05:50,808 --> 00:05:51,809
Where are we?

57
00:05:55,563 --> 00:05:57,398
What was that?

58
00:05:57,482 --> 00:05:58,983
Where's Anastasia?

59
00:05:59,067 --> 00:06:00,151
What is going on?

60
00:06:00,234 --> 00:06:01,986
Where's Anastasia?

61
00:06:02,528 --> 00:06:04,947
Are you worried about me, Jolyne?

62
00:06:06,449 --> 00:06:08,701
I'm touched that you care about me.

63
00:06:09,452 --> 00:06:12,371
But first, we need to find the priest.

64
00:06:12,914 --> 00:06:15,208
He was engulfed by light,
and I lost sight of him.

65
00:06:15,291 --> 00:06:18,294
We have to find the Space Shuttle, now!

66
00:06:18,377 --> 00:06:20,254
The Shuttle is right over there.

67
00:06:20,755 --> 00:06:22,423
The Shuttle hasn't moved,

68
00:06:22,507 --> 00:06:23,758
but we have.

69
00:06:23,841 --> 00:06:26,803
We shifted about 200 meters
from where we were.

70
00:06:27,386 --> 00:06:29,138
Just a moment ago,

71
00:06:29,222 --> 00:06:31,349
we were on the other side
of that building.

72
00:06:32,391 --> 00:06:34,977
I hate to point this out, Jotaro,

73
00:06:35,061 --> 00:06:37,814
but I didn't feel any impact
moving us here.

74
00:06:38,314 --> 00:06:40,399
Did anyone see anything?

75
00:06:40,483 --> 00:06:43,528
We must have been blasted to this side
by the reversed gravity.

76
00:06:43,611 --> 00:06:48,533
The direction of gravity
went back to normal a moment ago.

77
00:06:49,075 --> 00:06:52,328
Besides, Pucchi said
he no longer has See Moon.

78
00:06:53,538 --> 00:06:55,373
Jolyne, where is the priest?

79
00:06:55,456 --> 00:06:57,708
Can you sense where he is?

80
00:06:58,417 --> 00:07:03,589
I can sense that he's close,
but that's about it.

81
00:07:04,173 --> 00:07:08,052
His location and direction
are undetectable.

82
00:07:08,136 --> 00:07:09,512
I can't tell.

83
00:07:11,222 --> 00:07:12,056
What bothers me more

84
00:07:12,557 --> 00:07:13,975
is how Pucchi saw my harpoon.

85
00:07:14,058 --> 00:07:18,521
He eyed the Star Platinum harpoon
in stopped time.

86
00:07:24,735 --> 00:07:27,738
He saw the harpoon, so he evaded it.

87
00:07:28,322 --> 00:07:29,699
But how?

88
00:07:34,203 --> 00:07:35,204
I get it now.

89
00:07:36,164 --> 00:07:38,458
The priest was just talking nonsense.

90
00:07:38,541 --> 00:07:41,127
The time of heaven,
completing his Stand, whatever!

91
00:07:41,210 --> 00:07:43,171
He was just bluffing.

92
00:07:43,254 --> 00:07:48,384
He just used trickery to deceive us,
so that he can hide.

93
00:07:48,968 --> 00:07:52,096
He thinks he can completely lose us now.

94
00:07:52,680 --> 00:07:53,556
Ermes,

95
00:07:53,639 --> 00:07:55,641
it's in your best interest
not to step in there.

96
00:07:55,725 --> 00:07:57,977
- What?
- Stay in an open area.

97
00:07:58,478 --> 00:07:59,562
This rain will soon…

98
00:08:11,324 --> 00:08:13,576
I'm… drenched.

99
00:08:16,120 --> 00:08:17,830
What's going on, guys?

100
00:08:21,125 --> 00:08:22,376
Ermes?

101
00:08:23,127 --> 00:08:24,462
What are you doing?

102
00:08:24,545 --> 00:08:27,381
It's this automatic door!

103
00:08:28,841 --> 00:08:30,510
It's super fast!

104
00:08:32,345 --> 00:08:33,596
What the hell?

105
00:08:33,679 --> 00:08:35,640
It's snapping shut like a hydraulic press!

106
00:08:37,767 --> 00:08:38,768
I'm dry.

107
00:08:39,685 --> 00:08:41,270
I was soaked a moment ago.

108
00:08:41,354 --> 00:08:44,023
What the hell is going on?

109
00:08:44,524 --> 00:08:46,150
Watch your head, Ermes.

110
00:08:53,407 --> 00:08:54,325
What?

111
00:08:56,369 --> 00:08:58,037
It's time for the evening news.

112
00:08:58,538 --> 00:08:59,580
We have a developing story

113
00:08:59,664 --> 00:09:02,667
on the State Road 405 incident
at Cape Canaveral.

114
00:09:03,668 --> 00:09:06,504
Oh? Um, my apologies.

115
00:09:07,004 --> 00:09:08,130
I almost skipped the break.

116
00:09:08,214 --> 00:09:11,050
Wait, the break ended already?

117
00:09:18,224 --> 00:09:21,269
The sun…It's dusk!

118
00:09:22,311 --> 00:09:26,566
Well, can I have chocolate nuts, caramel,

119
00:09:26,649 --> 00:09:29,360
strawberry chocolate chips, and mint?

120
00:09:29,443 --> 00:09:31,904
Oh, and top it off with orange vanilla.

121
00:09:32,488 --> 00:09:33,948
That'll be six dollars.

122
00:09:40,288 --> 00:09:41,539
What the…

123
00:09:44,625 --> 00:09:45,876
Strike!

124
00:09:45,960 --> 00:09:48,963
Wow, look at this rookie go!

125
00:09:49,046 --> 00:09:51,215
He's been named our MVP!

126
00:09:54,343 --> 00:09:56,512
Oh, am I actually that good?

127
00:10:05,354 --> 00:10:07,607
The tissue hardened.

128
00:10:07,690 --> 00:10:09,275
Ouch…

129
00:10:09,358 --> 00:10:10,484
It's stuck to my nose!

130
00:10:11,068 --> 00:10:14,697
Barry, go grab
a 20-kilogram chunk of meat.

131
00:10:14,780 --> 00:10:16,449
On it, boss.

132
00:10:21,078 --> 00:10:22,413
He finally got a hit!

133
00:10:22,496 --> 00:10:24,665
Unfortunately, it's a pitcher's fly!

134
00:10:31,088 --> 00:10:32,048
What happened?

135
00:10:32,131 --> 00:10:33,633
He's bleeding like crazy!

136
00:10:33,716 --> 00:10:35,468
How did his blood get everywhere?

137
00:10:49,815 --> 00:10:51,108
We lost control!

138
00:10:51,192 --> 00:10:53,569
We're crashing at top speed!

139
00:10:53,653 --> 00:10:56,322
But the readings are all within range!

140
00:10:56,405 --> 00:10:57,365
We're dead.

141
00:10:57,448 --> 00:10:58,324
Pull up!

142
00:11:02,870 --> 00:11:04,372
What was that?

143
00:11:04,455 --> 00:11:05,665
What in the world is happening?

144
00:11:09,251 --> 00:11:10,378
Ermes!

145
00:11:11,003 --> 00:11:12,922
It wasn't a bluff.

146
00:11:13,005 --> 00:11:17,676
The priest wasn't just telling lies
to get away.

147
00:11:17,760 --> 00:11:19,345
And my blood…

148
00:11:19,970 --> 00:11:22,640
I haven't stopped bleeding,

149
00:11:23,224 --> 00:11:25,684
but my blood is already dry.

150
00:11:25,768 --> 00:11:27,645
Fresh blood is drying up!

151
00:11:28,354 --> 00:11:30,773
Jolyne, look at the blood on your face.

152
00:11:30,856 --> 00:11:34,276
It's drying up and crusting!

153
00:11:34,360 --> 00:11:35,903
You're right.

154
00:11:35,986 --> 00:11:38,072
What could be causing this?

155
00:11:42,326 --> 00:11:43,160
This can't be…

156
00:11:43,828 --> 00:11:46,497
It must have started at that moment!

157
00:11:46,580 --> 00:11:50,334
The priest has been executing his ability
since he was in the Shuttle!

158
00:11:52,461 --> 00:11:54,880
All things are moving
at an incredible speed!

159
00:11:55,381 --> 00:11:56,841
Everything in this world,

160
00:11:56,924 --> 00:12:01,595
not only man-made things,
but things in nature too!

161
00:12:02,179 --> 00:12:04,181
The sun is already down!

162
00:12:04,265 --> 00:12:06,100
The stars are beginning to come out!

163
00:12:06,183 --> 00:12:09,186
Is this his completed ability?

164
00:12:19,238 --> 00:12:20,948
STAND NAME: STAR PLATINUM
STAND MASTER: JOTARO KUJO

165
00:12:22,992 --> 00:12:26,120
What in the world is going on?

166
00:12:26,829 --> 00:12:30,207
This is caused by
the priest's new ability.

167
00:12:30,958 --> 00:12:32,376
Shit!

168
00:12:32,460 --> 00:12:34,211
The stars and the clouds are drifting

169
00:12:34,295 --> 00:12:36,338
like special effects in a movie!

170
00:12:36,422 --> 00:12:39,008
Is this the priest's
fully developed ability?

171
00:12:42,428 --> 00:12:44,138
There's more.

172
00:12:44,221 --> 00:12:47,141
Time. It's accelerating!

173
00:12:47,224 --> 00:12:50,144
Time is passing faster and faster!

174
00:12:51,145 --> 00:12:53,647
In this situation, is he the only one?

175
00:12:53,731 --> 00:12:55,316
What if no one else can function

176
00:12:55,399 --> 00:12:57,860
in the flow of this accelerated time?

177
00:12:58,360 --> 00:13:00,154
That's highly likely.

178
00:13:00,237 --> 00:13:02,823
When he dodged my harpoon,

179
00:13:03,449 --> 00:13:05,367
he may have done so unconsciously.

180
00:13:05,451 --> 00:13:10,414
But what if he can keep up
with this accelerated time?

181
00:13:10,998 --> 00:13:13,083
What if he realized what he's capable of?

182
00:13:13,751 --> 00:13:15,294
Jolyne, we can't stay here.

183
00:13:16,086 --> 00:13:20,049
It's dangerous.
It's not safe to be here like this.

184
00:13:23,969 --> 00:13:27,097
- No…
- Do you sense him too, Jolyne?

185
00:13:27,681 --> 00:13:29,683
- Do you sense his presence?
- What?

186
00:13:30,267 --> 00:13:31,727
Where is he?

187
00:13:31,810 --> 00:13:33,062
He's on the move.

188
00:13:33,646 --> 00:13:35,064
I can't tell his exact position,

189
00:13:35,856 --> 00:13:38,317
but he's approaching us from the shadows!

190
00:13:41,320 --> 00:13:43,572
This is bad, we need to go.

191
00:13:44,323 --> 00:13:47,743
Everyone, get moving! Quickly!

192
00:13:52,122 --> 00:13:54,250
Star Platinum: The World!

193
00:14:03,634 --> 00:14:05,928
My ability's duration is shortened!

194
00:14:06,011 --> 00:14:07,304
This is bad!

195
00:14:09,098 --> 00:14:10,891
This way, Jotaro!

196
00:14:16,480 --> 00:14:17,356
You…

197
00:14:17,856 --> 00:14:19,858
- Your name is Anastasia, correct?
- That's right.

198
00:14:20,943 --> 00:14:22,611
My Stand is called Diver Drive.

199
00:14:23,195 --> 00:14:25,364
It can submerge into various surfaces.

200
00:14:26,448 --> 00:14:27,867
Let's go look out at the other side.

201
00:14:27,950 --> 00:14:33,247
Yeah. But considering his speed,
being on the lookout may not help much.

202
00:14:34,832 --> 00:14:36,292
By the way, Jotaro…

203
00:14:37,418 --> 00:14:40,379
I will do everything I can
to protect your daughter.

204
00:14:40,963 --> 00:14:43,674
Yes, things may seem desperate,

205
00:14:44,341 --> 00:14:46,302
but we'll make it out of this fight.

206
00:14:47,428 --> 00:14:50,306
So please, allow me
to take your daughter's hand in marriage.

207
00:14:50,389 --> 00:14:54,268
What did you just say?

208
00:14:54,351 --> 00:14:57,897
I said, please give me your permission.

209
00:14:57,980 --> 00:15:00,858
Jotaro, let me marry your daughter.

210
00:15:03,986 --> 00:15:07,907
I know this isn't the right time,
but all I want is your blessing.

211
00:15:08,407 --> 00:15:13,996
If only I had your permission,
then I can be at peace.

212
00:15:15,581 --> 00:15:20,502
I don't really believe
that Jolyne would marry me.

213
00:15:21,211 --> 00:15:23,631
It's true that I've been
sentenced for murder,

214
00:15:23,714 --> 00:15:27,635
and I also know that
Jolyne would never fall for me.

215
00:15:28,218 --> 00:15:33,933
But the strong drive and mind
that she inherited from you

216
00:15:34,016 --> 00:15:36,936
sheds light into the darkness of my heart.

217
00:15:39,438 --> 00:15:42,232
She lightened my heart,
which was on the verge of collapsing!

218
00:15:42,316 --> 00:15:44,151
Please, I need it now.

219
00:15:44,735 --> 00:15:46,320
Just one word will do.

220
00:15:46,403 --> 00:15:47,529
Say you'll allow me.

221
00:15:48,113 --> 00:15:50,199
Please liberate my heart.

222
00:15:50,699 --> 00:15:54,578
If we make it out of this alive,
allow me to marry her!

223
00:15:56,455 --> 00:15:58,040
I don't understand.

224
00:15:58,666 --> 00:16:01,085
Have you lost your mind
from all this madness?

225
00:16:03,671 --> 00:16:04,838
Anastasia.

226
00:16:07,800 --> 00:16:09,343
We need to stay together.

227
00:16:09,426 --> 00:16:12,054
Everyone, don't wander off.

228
00:16:14,306 --> 00:16:18,811
We made it up on the roof,
but now we have nowhere to run.

229
00:16:18,894 --> 00:16:20,854
Besides, he's on the move.

230
00:16:22,314 --> 00:16:23,857
But I can't sense his movement.

231
00:16:24,358 --> 00:16:29,321
I barricaded the area with my strings,
but who knows what good it'll do?

232
00:16:29,822 --> 00:16:32,825
Though the priest succeeded
in completing his ability,

233
00:16:32,908 --> 00:16:35,619
he has no intention of letting us live.

234
00:16:35,703 --> 00:16:38,247
He wants to settle his score with us.

235
00:16:39,790 --> 00:16:41,291
He is determined

236
00:16:41,375 --> 00:16:45,129
to settle the score
with the Joestar bloodline.

237
00:16:45,212 --> 00:16:47,965
I get it,
but his Stand is too unpredictable!

238
00:16:48,048 --> 00:16:50,175
How are we supposed to fight against it?

239
00:16:50,259 --> 00:16:52,803
Jotaro, allow us!

240
00:17:01,437 --> 00:17:04,773
Everyone, listen closely.

241
00:17:04,857 --> 00:17:06,692
It may appear as if we are cornered,

242
00:17:07,276 --> 00:17:09,278
but coming up to this roof
gave us an advantage.

243
00:17:10,279 --> 00:17:12,781
The priest's ability accelerates time.

244
00:17:13,282 --> 00:17:15,534
He's the only one who can move inside
the accelerated time.

245
00:17:15,617 --> 00:17:18,162
However, we can still see him.

246
00:17:18,746 --> 00:17:21,290
Judging from my watch,

247
00:17:22,041 --> 00:17:26,587
it takes about two minutes
for an hour to pass.

248
00:17:26,670 --> 00:17:27,755
This is what it means.

249
00:17:27,838 --> 00:17:29,965
If he runs at 10 kilometers per hour,

250
00:17:30,049 --> 00:17:33,302
he'll appear as if he's moving
at the speed of a bullet train.

251
00:17:34,011 --> 00:17:38,807
It sounds fast, but our eyes
can observe a moving bullet train.

252
00:17:38,891 --> 00:17:40,392
Stay calm and observe.

253
00:17:40,893 --> 00:17:42,895
You will be able to tell
that he's moving, at least.

254
00:17:43,395 --> 00:17:45,314
Try to sense his movements.

255
00:17:45,397 --> 00:17:47,316
He's 30 times faster than us.

256
00:17:47,816 --> 00:17:51,528
A car going 60kph would be 1,800kph,

257
00:17:52,112 --> 00:17:54,490
and a car going 100kph would be Mach 2.4.

258
00:17:55,074 --> 00:17:56,075
Correct.

259
00:17:56,158 --> 00:17:57,367
However, the priest is wary

260
00:17:57,451 --> 00:18:00,329
and remains cautious
in coming to this rooftop.

261
00:18:01,038 --> 00:18:05,959
He knows that I can stop time,
though only for a few seconds.

262
00:18:06,043 --> 00:18:08,253
There's also the unknown factor.

263
00:18:09,296 --> 00:18:11,799
We don't know
what his ability will become.

264
00:18:12,382 --> 00:18:16,053
He himself is yearning to see it evolve.

265
00:18:17,930 --> 00:18:20,307
Star Platinum: The World.

266
00:18:30,317 --> 00:18:31,318
Where is he?

267
00:18:31,401 --> 00:18:33,070
Where did he go?

268
00:18:33,153 --> 00:18:35,447
I saw something move under that table.

269
00:18:35,531 --> 00:18:37,366
He's closing in on us.

270
00:18:38,367 --> 00:18:41,078
I can stop time for five seconds at most.

271
00:18:41,578 --> 00:18:45,833
In just five seconds,
I must find him and finish him off.

272
00:18:46,667 --> 00:18:49,628
Good grief, he's nowhere to be found.

273
00:18:49,711 --> 00:18:52,589
Did I just imagine a flickering shadow?

274
00:18:53,298 --> 00:18:54,424
Time's up.

275
00:18:54,925 --> 00:18:56,135
Time will now start again…

276
00:19:00,097 --> 00:19:01,390
The palm tree!

277
00:19:01,473 --> 00:19:02,808
He hid behind the leaves!

278
00:19:02,891 --> 00:19:03,976
What?

279
00:19:04,059 --> 00:19:06,728
No way. He's using the tree's flexibility!

280
00:19:06,812 --> 00:19:09,273
My ability is at its limit.
Time will start again!

281
00:19:09,356 --> 00:19:11,024
He'll catapult himself using the tree!

282
00:19:18,615 --> 00:19:19,616
Above?

283
00:19:42,264 --> 00:19:43,098
Dad…

284
00:19:43,682 --> 00:19:44,892
Jolyne, behind you!

285
00:19:45,475 --> 00:19:46,643
He's coming again!

286
00:19:54,359 --> 00:19:55,319
Anastasia.

287
00:19:57,613 --> 00:20:02,659
You submerged your Stand into my body.

288
00:20:04,620 --> 00:20:07,080
You took damage in my place.

289
00:20:07,706 --> 00:20:11,126
You served as armor
to mitigate the damage.

290
00:20:11,210 --> 00:20:12,419
And yet…

291
00:20:27,851 --> 00:20:29,269
It's too short.

292
00:20:29,353 --> 00:20:32,272
Five seconds just isn't enough.

293
00:20:32,356 --> 00:20:35,234
I can't activate
my Time Stop ability consecutively! 

294
00:20:36,235 --> 00:20:39,196
Once Star Platinum stops time
for five seconds,

295
00:20:39,988 --> 00:20:44,660
it can't launch for a brief moment.

296
00:20:45,410 --> 00:20:51,667
Our only chance to defeat the priest
is for me to get in range.

297
00:20:52,209 --> 00:20:56,588
And only when the time is stopped!

298
00:20:59,007 --> 00:21:00,092
I'm at the limit.

299
00:21:00,592 --> 00:21:02,427
Time now starts again.

300
00:21:10,560 --> 00:21:12,271
Dad! Anastasia!

301
00:21:23,240 --> 00:21:27,369
My first target is no longer Jotaro,
but Anastasia.

302
00:21:27,452 --> 00:21:29,413
Yes, I will finish him off first.

303
00:21:29,496 --> 00:21:31,039
Listen closely.

304
00:21:31,123 --> 00:21:33,917
This may be beyond your comprehension,

305
00:21:34,501 --> 00:21:36,670
but I will part with this last remark.

306
00:21:37,379 --> 00:21:39,047
Time will accelerate.

307
00:21:40,299 --> 00:21:46,013
I did not obtain this power
to end your lives,

308
00:21:46,096 --> 00:21:48,849
nor does this ability promise me
supreme strength.

309
00:21:50,642 --> 00:21:56,148
This power's purpose is to guide
the human race towards true happiness.

310
00:21:56,648 --> 00:22:00,902
My new Stand, my new ability.

311
00:22:01,403 --> 00:22:03,238
I shall give it a name.

312
00:22:03,989 --> 00:22:05,782
Maiden Heaven!

313
00:23:41,336 --> 00:23:46,341
Subtitle translation by: Megumi Hunter
